            <ArticleTitle>Torsion of cavernous lymphangioma: an unusual cause of acute scrotum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1296-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of scrotal cavernous lymphangioma is described. Torsion of the pedicle resulted in an acute scrotal emergency that required surgical treatment.</AbstractText>
